'''Seashore Kai''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] gacha event. She is an anti-[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]] that was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 354
|rarity = UR
