|name2 = Seashore Kai, type μ
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Seashore Kai, type μ''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Seashore Kai's forte is tanking Dark/Zombie enemies with high damage and slow attack rates, such as [[Le'noir]], [[Director Kurosawah]], [[Zamelle]] and [[Daboo of the Dead]]. She isn't efficient when fighting groups of Dark/Zombie enemies with high DPS, but she can be useful to stall said enemies and allow the player to level up their [[Worker Cat]] if the DPS of the enemies in-field isn't too high.

One of her best uses is for holding the meatshield line for a short amount of time. Especially when fighting Dark enemies, if all of your meatshields and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercats]] are killed by a backliner's attack, Seashore Kai can be used to hold the line so that the peons don't push too far.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker}}

