==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], she could be obtained from the [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] gacha event.
*Seashore Kai's Japanese description states that her inflatable dolphin is called Triton, a name half-shared with the default [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]]'s mount, Tonton (Tri<u>ton</u>, Ton<u>ton</u>).
**While Triton is the son of [[Wrathful Poseidon (Uber Rare Cat)|Poseidon]] in Greek mythology, it could also be a reference to the dolphin-riding protagonist of the same name from the manga ''[[wikipedia:Triton of the Sea|Triton of the Sea]]''.
*Barring [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|collab exclusives]], Seashore Kai's English description is the only instance in which another [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] character is directly mentioned in a unit's description.
*In the English [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] posters featuring Seashore Kai and [[Waverider Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Waverider Kuu]], Seashore Kai was referred to as "Seaside Kai".

